          <p><strong>Nothing can stop an idea whose time has come.</strong></p>
          <p>The space industry is at an inflection point. Shifts in how space businesses are built, and a wave of agile startups, have lowered the barrier to new technology and increased the capacity and viability of the space economy.</p>
          <p><a href="https://medium.com/@mcapezzani/the-space-accelerando-3b8170f10f8e" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read The Space Accelerando</a></p>
