      <article class="home-essay">
        <a href="https://blog.prototypr.io/apps-for-martians-c494f7809c95" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <img src="{{ '/assets/images/apps-for-martians.webp' | url }}" alt="Apps for martians" width="294" height="209" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        <div class="home-essay-copy">
          <h3><a class="block-link" href="https://blog.prototypr.io/apps-for-martians-c494f7809c95" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apps for martians. <span class="year">2017.</span></a></h3>
          <p><strong>Mars is of sublime and magnificent beauty.</strong></p>
          <p>Mountains, valleys and mesas take your breath away and leave you wanting. Through robot eyes or your own, every shade of red, brown, purple and ochre combines in a landscape of greater reach and extremes than Earth. The weather is hostile and the terrain inhospitable, yet we will cross the void at any cost.</p>
          <p><a href="https://blog.prototypr.io/apps-for-martians-c494f7809c95" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Apps for martians</a></p>
